            <ArticleTitle>Calcified adrenal cysts.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>777-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two case of calcified adrenal cysts are reported. Previously proposed diagnostic criteria for the recognition of a parenchymatous cyst was identified in our first case. Pain has been the main feature in our two cases.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
